        <item>
            <title>2.34.0</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 01:33:05 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>120</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.34.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Features

- **Copy Session Log Path** — a new sidebar context-menu item on closed sessions. Copies that session's transcript path so you can paste it into a new session and have it read the old conversation for reference.

### Bug Fixes

- Sessions started inside a git worktree no longer disappear from the sidebar once that worktree is removed. They stay in Recents, still labelled with the repository and branch they ran in.
- Those sessions are now drawn dimmed, and clicking one does nothing instead of failing: their working directory is gone, so they cannot be reopened. Their log is still reachable through Copy Session Log Path.
]]></description>
